  storyText: "Kaz's Garage\n\nKaz waits by a battered Quadra. Next to him stands a woman in a perfect black suit. Arasaka.\n\nKaz shrugs. \"Sorry, choom. 50k is 50k.\"\n\n1. Go with her quietly.\n2. Run.\n3. \"Mirage, do something!\""
